      "subject": "ארמי אובד אבי",
      "rationale": "Bayɛlɛmabaga bɛɛ tiɲɛ bɛ u ka nɔ ye: 'Aramiden min ma sigi yen' (Yaakɔb), 'Aramiden min tun bɛɛ ka bɔrɔ', walima 'Aramiden ye ne fa ju' (Laban min tun ye Israyel ju)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "i",
      "rationale": "Kumasen in dalen bɛ saraka-baga la — a ye deŋ-yɛlɛma-kalan ye min bɛ fɔ Yawe ɲɛda la."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "במתי מעט",
      "rationale": "Heburukan fɔra ko 'mɔgɔ siranngu fitininw' — o bɛ fɔ 'jama fitinin' kɔrɔ la, Bamanankan na an ta daɲɛ 'mɔgɔ fitininw' la."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "I na bisigi kɔrɔ ani i na fɔ Yawe, i ka Elohim, ɲɛda la ko: Aramiden min bɛ lajigi-yɛlɛma la, o ye ne fa ye; a na a sigi Misira (Mitsrayim) la, a ye a digi yen mɔgɔ fitininw la, a kɛra yen siya bon ye, ka se kosɛbɛ, ka mɔgɔ caman sɔrɔ.",
